# Deployment Rules

## Repository Structure
- **Primary Source**: Your forked repository (remote origin)
- **Upstream**: Google's Bank of Anthos (upstream)
- **Branch**: `feat/fraud-detection`
- **Purpose**: Source repository for cluster deployment with fraud detection features

## Repository Management
```bash
# Sync with upstream
git fetch upstream
git merge upstream/main

# Push to your fork
git push origin feat/fraud-detection

# Create feature branches
git checkout -b feature/ai-insights-popup
git push origin feature/ai-insights-popup
```

## Build Process for Forked Repo
```bash
# Activate environment
export PATH="/Users/shayan/anaconda3/envs/fraud-detection/bin:$PATH"

# Build Java services (for future deployment)
cd src/ledger/ledgerwriter
../../../mvnw clean compile jib:build -Dimage=gcr.io/finance-project-471400/ledgerwriter:v0.7.0

# Build Python services
cd src/ai-services/fraud-detection
docker buildx build --platform linux/amd64 -t gcr.io/finance-project-471400/fraud-detection:latest . --push

# Build frontend
cd src/frontend
docker buildx build --platform linux/amd64 -t gcr.io/finance-project-471400/frontend:v0.7.0 . --push
```

